  "summary": {
    "headline": "Codex Affinities and Owners",
    "text": "Index of codices recording manuscript affinities, dated notes from 907? to 1542, scribes and possessors, and concordances between Florentine codex numbers. Named owners include Lorenzo de' Medici, Antonio Magliabechi, Nicodemus the monk, Ioannes Abramios, Giovanni Pico della Mirandola, Angelo Poliziano, Papa Manuel of Marmara, and Manuel Atrapes."
  }
